OL,3,GNEWSAWill the 'powerful men' debate
OL,4,Achange Scotland's sexual consent law?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIs a change in the age of sexual
OL,7,Fconsent in Scotland likely as part of
OL,8,Fthe debate on predatory behaviour by
OL,9,Fpowerful men?
OL,11,FThe past fortnight has seen a flurry of
OL,12,Fheadlines about Russell Brand's rape
OL,13,Fconviction and allegations of sexual
OL,14,Fmisconduct by David Walliams, which the
OL,15,Fcomedian and author denies.
OL,17,FA woman who alleges she was raped by
OL,18,FBrand when she was 16 and he was 30 has
OL,19,Fnow waived her right to anonymity to
OL,20,Fcall for a law change to protect
OL,21,Fteenagers.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
