OL,3,GNEWSAWill the 'powerful men' debate
OL,4,Achange Scotland's sexual consent law?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMia Latter was not one of the
OL,7,Fcomplainants at Brand's trial but was
OL,8,Fone of six women who made allegations
OL,9,Fagainst him as part of a Times, Sunday
OL,10,FTimes and Channel 4 investigation in
OL,11,F2023.
